<div style="height:0;overflow:hidden"><input type="submit" title="submit"  disabled></div><div  class="Section"  data-gx-base-lib="bootstrapv3" data-abstract-form ><div id="LAYOUTMAINTABLE_MPAGE"  class="MainContainerWithFooter" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLEMAIN_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLEMAIN1_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 MasterHeaderCellLandingCongo" ><div id="TABLEHEADERFIXWIDTH_MPAGE"  class="TableContentLandingCongo" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 CellPaddingLeftRight0XS" ><div id="TABLEHEADER_MPAGE"  class="Flex"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="align-self:flex-start;"  classref ><img src="Resources/FormLogo.png" data-gx-evt="7" id="LOGOHEADER_MPAGE" data-gx-readonly  alt="" class="ImageTop logo-moveL ImageTop1 GX_Image_FormLogo_Class"  data-gx-image   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 17,'',true,'',0)"/></div><div  class="CellPaddingLeftRight0XS CellPaddingLeft30 HorizontalMenuCell"  style="flex-grow:1;" ><div class="gx_usercontrol" id="UCMENU_MPAGEContainer"></div></div><div  class="CellHeaderBar hidden-xs" ><div id="TABLEUSERROLE_MPAGE"  class="Flex"  style="display:none;align-items:flex-end;"  data-gx-flex ><div  class="MasterTopIconsCell" ><div class="gx_usercontrol" id="DDC_ADMINAG_MPAGEContainer"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div id="TABLETITLECELL_MPAGE"  class="col-xs-12 CellTitleMasterLandingCongo" ><div id="TABLETITLE_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><span class="TextBlockTitleMaster"  style="display:none;"  id="TEXTBLOCKTITLE_MPAGE" > Title </span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="TextBlock"  style="display:none;"  id="SUBTITLE_MPAGE"  data-gxformat="1" >Developer Menu > Person</div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLECONTENT_MPAGE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div id="CONTENTHOLDERCELL_MPAGE"  class="col-xs-12 CellTableContentHorizontalMenu" ><div class="gx-content-placeholder" ><div class="gx-ct-body form-horizontal Form-fx" ><div  class="Section"  data-gx-base-lib="bootstrapv3" data-abstract-form ><div id="LAYOUTMAINTABLE"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLEMAIN"  class="TableMain TableMain_MT" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 TB-bnpd0" ><div id="BANNER"  class="BN-img BN_H120" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE4"  class="TableContentLandingCongo tx-s" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 tb-bnpos" ><span class="tb-bnfont"  id="TB_BANNER" >Find a CPA (Practising)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 marginTB" ><div id="TABLECONTENT"  class="TableContentLandingCongo" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div><span class="ErrorViewer gx_ev ErrorViewerBullet"  data-gx-id="gxErrorViewer"></span></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 CellPaddingBottom" ><div id="TABLEHEADER"  class="Flex"  style="display:none;flex-direction:column;"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="flex-grow:1;"  classref ><div id="TABLEHEADERCONTENT"  class="Flex"  style="flex-wrap:wrap;"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="flex-grow:1;"  classref ><div id="TABLEACTIONS"  class="Flex"  data-gx-flex ><div  style="align-self:center;"  classref ><span class="TextBlockTitleWWP"  id="TEXTBLOCKTITLE" >Find a CPA (Practising)</span></div></div></div><div  classref ><div id="TABLERIGHTHEADER"  class="Flex"  style="flex-wrap:wrap;"  data-gx-flex ><div  class="CellAlignTopPaddingTop2"  style="flex-grow:1;" ><div class="gx_usercontrol" id="DDO_MANAGEFILTERSContainer"></div></div><div  style="flex-grow:1;"  classref ></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12 hidden-xs hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg" ><span class="tb-bnfont2"  id="TEXTBLOCK1" >Find a CPA (Practising)</span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="Attribute TextBlock16px txt_Jtf tb_black"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK2"  data-gxformat="1" ><p>Under the Accounting and Financial Reporting Council Ordinance (Cap. 588), only a certified public accountant (practising) (<strong>CPA (practising)</strong>), a CPA firm or a corporate practice registered with the Accounting and Financial Reporting Council (<strong>AFRC</strong>) can hold an appointment or render a service, whether paid or unpaid, as an auditor of a company under the Companies Ordinance (Cap. 622) or accounts for the purposes of any other Ordinance.</p></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE1"  class="Table"  style="height:10px;" ></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="Attribute TextBlock16px txt_Jtf tb_black"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK6"  data-gxformat="1" ><p>The register of CPAs (practising) is published by the AFRC for the purpose of enabling the public to ascertain whether they are dealing with a CPA (practising) issued with a practising certificate by the AFRC, and to ascertain their particulars. Any personal data or other data contained in the register of CPAs (practising) must not be used for any non-directly related purposes. It is a criminal offence under the Personal Data (Privacy) Ordinance (Cap. 486) to use the personal data in the register of CPAs (practising) for direct marketing without the data subjects' consent.</p></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="UNNAMEDTABLE2"  class="Table"  style="height:10px;" ></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div class="Attribute TextBlock16px txt_Jtf tb_black"  style="display:inline;"  id="TEXTBLOCK7"  data-gxformat="1" ><p>Whilst the AFRC has taken all reasonable steps to ensure the accuracy of the entries, it accepts no responsibility for any errors or omissions in the register of CPAs (practising).</p></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><span class="TextBlock"  id="TEXTBLOCK5" >  </span></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div id="TABLE_SEARCH"  class="Table" ><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div  class="form-group gx-form-group"  data-gx-for="vNAME"><label  class="gx-label col-sm-3 AttributeLabel input_widthLabel control-label" for="vNAME">English name:</label><div  class="col-sm-9 gx-attribute" ><input type="text" id="vNAME" name="vNAME" value="" size="80" placeholder="English name of the person (in English only)" spellcheck="true" maxlength="100" class="Attribute input_width"  style="text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 64,'',false,'0001',0)" onchange=";gx.evt.onchange(this, event)"  onblur=";gx.evt.onblur(this,64);"/></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div  class="form-group gx-form-group"  data-gx-for="vCHINESENAME"><label  class="gx-label col-sm-3 AttributeLabel input_widthLabel control-label" for="vCHINESENAME">Chinese name:</label><div  class="col-sm-9 gx-attribute" ><input type="text" id="vCHINESENAME" name="vCHINESENAME" value="" size="80" placeholder="Chinese name of the person (in Chinese only)" spellcheck="true" maxlength="100" class="Attribute input_width"  style="text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onfocus(this, 69,'',false,'0001',0)" onchange=";gx.evt.onchange(this, event)"  onblur=";gx.evt.onblur(this,69);"/></div></div></div></div><div  class="row" ><div  class="col-xs-12" ><div  class="form-group gx-form-group"  data-gx-for="vREGNO"><label  class="gx-label col-sm-3 AttributeLabel input_widthLabel control-label" for="vREGNO">Registration number:</label><div  class="col-sm-9 gx-attribute" ><input type="text" id="vREGNO" name="vREGNO" value="" size="40" placeholder="Practising certificate number" spellcheck="true" maxlength="40" class="Attribute input_width"  style="text-align:left"   onfocus="gx.evt.onf